From 0c7701676f2e13c782eade3e21cd17c87f1be940 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rama Krishna Phani A <ramkri@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 14:41:36 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: qcom-ecam: Refactor power domain handling and fix init/deinit issues

This patch addresses multiple critical issues in the Qualcomm PCIe ECAM
driver related to power domain management, safety feature handling, and
sysfs attribute organization. Changes are made to address
Power Domain Lifecycle Management, Safety Feature Refactoring,
Sysfs Attribute Reorganization, Resource Handling Improvements.

Change-Id: I322a426a830f50bdb451402302fb8f8df4e9bc75
Signed-off-by: Rama Krishna Phani A <ramkri@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/pci/controller/pcie-qcom-ecam.c | 515 ++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 347 insertions(+), 168 deletions(-)

